<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description>This macro us universal, it does not matter what your visual settings are. This macro is set up with the default double-z bind in EFT, change the keys to the proper keys if you have set up a custom bind. There is not much else needed to be said; the macro is pretty straightforward.</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>KeyDown 29 1
Delay 6 ms
KeyUp 29 1
Delay 5 ms
KeyDown 29 1
Delay 6 ms
KeyUp 29 1</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Escape From Tarkov</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>